# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python / RAG service
#
# Several patterns below are anchored to the repository root with a leading
# slash. Unanchored, `lib/` and `build/` match a directory of that name at ANY
# depth, which would silently ignore apps/renderer/src/shared/lib/ and
# apps/renderer/src/features/*/lib/. Already-tracked files would survive, but
# every new file added there would vanish from `git status`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[codz]
*$py.class

# C extensions
*.so

# Distribution / packaging
.Python
/build/
develop-eggs/
.eggs/
/lib/
/lib64/
/parts/
/sdist/
/var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

